 of our server rules. Not
 reading them isn't an
 excuse for breaking them.
 
 Use the station's Projection
 Console to order ships! Your
 first 10,000 PCU is free!

 Vye for control of the asteroid
 field, or dominate the market
 for top slots on the leaderboards!</Text>
